Auditing and Attacking Modern DevSecOps Systems
Learning Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

• Identify and exploit common Jenkins misconfigurations to gain unauthorized system access • Perform comprehensive secret scanning on container images and server filesystems • Conduct static security analysis of Kubernetes configurations using KubeLinter • Understand the security implications of misconfigured DevSecOps tools • Apply security best practices to prevent common DevSecOps vulnerabilities • Use open-source security tools to audit modern containerized environments

