• Basic understanding of Linux command line operations • Familiarity with Docker containers and basic containerization concepts • Basic knowledge of Kubernetes architecture and YAML configuration files • Understanding of CI/CD pipeline concepts • Basic networking knowledge (ports, services, HTTP requests) • Familiarity with text editors like nano or vim

